# L §3.1: a code position takes an expression of the code's type; "one of another family is refused" — here load sees
# it: the input md holds a roll, read where prorata takes a rounding mode (LOAD-UNIT, the type of the value; L §8.3).
=== m.tally
model pr
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index parts = [a, b, c]
input total: money PLN
input w[p in parts]: num
input md: roll

def share_list[p in parts]: money PLN = prorata(total, w[j] for j in [a, b], p, minor(PLN), md, rest none)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  total = 100.00 PLN
  w[a] = 1
  w[b] = 2
  w[c] = 3
  md = following

ask q1: share_list[p] for p in [a, b]

=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT prorata: the mode is roll, not a rounding code ...
